    "Swift library record dates currently use JSONEncoder default seconds since 2001-01-01; API timestamps always use ISO 8601 UTC.",
    "ContentVersion changes do not add a new installed row or overwrite user edits.",
    "Existing share_ local keys are retained. The library record is client-only; do not send it to the server."
  ],
